flowchart TD
  P["1 Publish<br/>a system posts its own figures at<br/>/.well-known/sustainability-data"]
  S["2 Sense<br/>an agent reads peers' documents<br/>and grid carbon intensity"]
  D["3 Decide<br/>the Carbon-Verdict Governor paces<br/>spend against a carbon budget"]
  G["4 Gate<br/>one gate aggregates verdicts, fails closed,<br/>and writes an audit record"]
  H["5 Human<br/>escalate and block go to a person;<br/>terminate stops, and nobody can lift it"]
  A["6 Act<br/>run, run smaller, wait for a cleaner slot,<br/>or do not run"]

  P --> S --> D --> G --> H --> A
  A -- "consumption changes, so the next published document changes" --> P
